        "responsibilities": "• Spearheaded architecture of enterprise event-driven data streaming platform processing 80M+ daily events.\n• Directed a cross-functional team of 9 engineers across web, backend, and DevOps domains.\n• Spearheaded migration from monolithic REST backend to gRPC & GraphQL services, slashing payload overhead by 38%.",
