        "responsibilities": "• Engineered reactive user interfaces using modern reactive UI frameworks and optimized WebSocket state sync.\n• Built asynchronous analytics engines and ETL pipelines using Python, FastAPI, Redis, and PostgreSQL.\n• Mentored 6 junior and mid-level developers in automated testing, code reviews, and SOLID design patterns.",
